---
title: Events
summary: Where to find Bluebird Advisory at upcoming events, and what we are learning from our work across government.
---
{# Events live in src/events/<slug>.md. Each one is listed under "Upcoming events" until its date
   (Canberra time, at build time), then moves to "Past events". The daily rebuild moves it the morning after. #}
{% from "partials/event.njk" import eventCard %}
{% set upcomingEvents = collections.events | upcoming %}
{% set pastEvents = collections.events | pastEvents %}
<h2>Upcoming events</h2>
<p>We regularly attend and speak at industry events across Canberra and beyond.</p>
{% for e in upcomingEvents %}{{ eventCard(e, true) }}{% else %}
<p>There are no upcoming events listed right now. Follow us on <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/bluebird-advisory/">LinkedIn</a> to hear about the next one.</p>
{% endfor %}

{% if pastEvents.length %}
<h2>Past events</h2>
{% for e in pastEvents %}{{ eventCard(e, false) }}{% endfor %}
{% endif %}

<script>
(function(){if(!window.HTMLDialogElement)return;
document.querySelectorAll('[data-dialog]').forEach(function(a){var d=document.getElementById(a.getAttribute('data-dialog'));if(!d)return;
a.addEventListener('click',function(e){e.preventDefault();d.showModal();});
d.addEventListener('click',function(e){if(e.target===d)d.close();});});
// Links such as /events/#ai-showcase-2026 (from the home page) open that event's popup
var t=location.hash&&document.getElementById(location.hash.slice(1));if(t&&t.tagName==='DIALOG')t.showModal();})();
</script>

<h2>Stay in touch</h2>
<p>Follow us on <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/bluebird-advisory/">LinkedIn</a> for event updates, or email <a href="mailto:contact@bluebirdadvisory.com.au?subject=Events">contact@bluebirdadvisory.com.au</a> to invite us to speak at your event.</p>
